Cell["The analytic \
remainder estimates give the main bound 4.3/q for real q >= 100 and |x| <= 1. \
The grid provides pointwise cross-checks. The verification cells below \
reproduce the arithmetic and numerical checks. The comparison with earlier \
literature remains open.", "Text", CellFrame -> False, 
         CellMargins -> {{42, 36}, {5, 9}}, FontFamily -> "Georgia", 
         FontSize -> 12, FontColor -> RGBColor[0, 0, 0], 
         ExpressionUUID -> "1536e885-76fd-4753-9488-15498b6f1355"]
}, Open  ]],

